[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "london-main 3.e3"]
[Name "The fianchetto with ...d5"]

3... g6 { Black claims the centre with a pawn and adds the fianchetto. The g7 bishop's diagonal is half closed by Black's own d-pawn. }
4. Nf3
4... Bg7
5. Be2 { Still the right square: the bishop is out of reach and covers the kingside. }
5... O-O
6. O-O { Castled, and h3 and c3 can come next, as usual. } *
